    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">to the extent we are eligible, in &ldquo;at
    the market offerings,&rdquo; within the meaning of Rule&nbsp;415(a)(4)&nbsp;of the&nbsp;Securities Act, to or through a market maker
