    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">directly to a purchaser pursuant to what
    is known as an &ldquo;equity line of credit&rdquo; as described below; or</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

